{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T17:53:33.597227378Z","event":{"type":"LabelAdded","issue_uuid":"e0584461-63fb-4412-b266-0c06d4c1cc03","label":"bug"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T17:57:22.292769096Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e0584461-63fb-4412-b266-0c06d4c1cc03","comment_uuid":"9913a31a-73d0-4079-b38d-3f4463a6b2d6","author":"anon-ab6221f8","content":"Implementing forecast-bio/crosslink#653 fixes 1+2 (+4). Approach:\n1. Divergence guard on adopt: in adopt_remote_v3, read the remote v3 HubMeta.migrated_from_commit (lightweight FETCH_HEAD read), compare against the live crosslink/hub (v2) tip via 'git rev-list --count <genesis>..<v2tip>'. If v2 is ahead, refuse to adopt (clear message with counts + remedies) unless new --adopt-stale flag is passed.\n2. Real re-migrate: new --remigrate-from-v2 flag regenerates the v3 genesis from the CURRENT v2 tip (reusing build_genesis_from_files + seed_v3_refs + AC-6 verify) and force-pushes to supersede the stale remote v3 refs. Extract migrate_phase_a body into a shared build_and_publish_v3(force_push) helper.\n3. Harden --finalize: refuse to delete the v2 branch when v2 is ahead of the v3 genesis (same divergence helper), so a stale adopt can never escalate to real loss.\nNew CLI flags on HubV3: --adopt-stale, --remigrate-from-v2. Tests for the divergence helper + adopt/finalize refusal + remigrate happy path.","created_at":"2026-06-22T17:57:22.292763197Z","kind":"plan"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T18:11:09.851836944Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e0584461-63fb-4412-b266-0c06d4c1cc03","comment_uuid":"c729f9bb-709e-4866-a284-7e6050ef8977","author":"anon-ab6221f8","content":"Committed 15f32cdf on fix/653-hub-v3-remigrate-divergence-guard (off develop). Delivered: (1) divergence guard on adopt with --adopt-stale override, (2) migrate hub-v3 --remigrate-from-v2 recovery path (force-push supersede), (3) hardened --finalize to refuse deleting v2 while ahead of v3. New hub_v3::push_ref_force. 4 new tests + all 16 migrate_hub_v3 + 15 operation tests green; clippy + fmt clean; CHANGELOG updated. Waiting on human push, then PR --base develop.","created_at":"2026-06-22T18:11:09.851830437Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T18:29:02.043561019Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"135aa6c0-bf14-4adc-9bc8-48ef375ebbac","title":"hub-v3: git worktree add --orphan fails on Git <2.42 (forecast-bio/crosslink#655)","priority":"high","created_by":"anon-ab6221f8"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":8,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T18:29:06.308332073Z","event":{"type":"LabelAdded","issue_uuid":"135aa6c0-bf14-4adc-9bc8-48ef375ebbac","label":"bug"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":9,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T18:36:53.316100800Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"135aa6c0-bf14-4adc-9bc8-48ef375ebbac","comment_uuid":"35b8a6e0-c1a6-4179-8522-b6666b6a9ed6","author":"anon-ab6221f8","content":"Fix forecast-bio/crosslink#655: git worktree add --orphan requires Git >=2.42.0; fails on Ubuntu 22.04's 2.34.1 with 'unknown option orphan'. Two production call sites: sync/cache.rs init_v3_host_worktree (crosslink/hub-v3-host) and knowledge/sync.rs init_cache (crosslink/knowledge). Added src/git_compat.rs with cached git-version detection (parse git --version, gate at 2.42) + add_orphan_worktree() that uses --orphan on new git and a fallback on old git: 'worktree add --detach' then 'checkout --orphan' then 'rm -rf .' to clear the tree, producing the identical unborn-orphan-empty-tree state. CROSSLINK_FORCE_WORKTREE_ORPHAN_FALLBACK env forces the fallback for testing. Both call sites rewired. Tests: version parse, gate boundary, fallback-equivalence (asserts unborn HEAD + empty index + root first commit); 320 sync+knowledge tests pass with the fallback FORCED end-to-end. clippy+fmt clean.","created_at":"2026-06-22T18:36:53.316093141Z","kind":"plan"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":10,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T18:47:11.883759937Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"4458c5a4-3ea7-45d5-9019-696ffc596bfc","title":"dashboard serve crashes serving static assets (forecast-bio/crosslink#654)","priority":"high","created_by":"anon-ab6221f8"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":11,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T18:47:16.420549810Z","event":{"type":"LabelAdded","issue_uuid":"4458c5a4-3ea7-45d5-9019-696ffc596bfc","label":"bug"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-ab6221f8","agent_seq":12,"timestamp":"2026-06-22T19:00:04.227638091Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"4458c5a4-3ea7-45d5-9019-696ffc596bfc","comment_uuid":"d13da9a5-2361-4239-86d8-4a1cfaaf5a7e","author":"anon-ab6221f8","content":"Investigation: cannot reproduce the reported crash on current develop (identical to beta commit 7854152b for src/server/*). Faithfully reproduced the reporter's setup: built the real Vite frontend (produces the EXACT asset index-COsZ_-s7.js, 621KB + index-CZch84yR.css), rebuilt a RELEASE binary so rust-embed embeds it, and tested BOTH serving modes:\n- embedded (cargo install path): GET / =200, GET /assets/index-COsZ_-s7.js =200 (full 621851 bytes), CSS =200 — process ALIVE.\n- --dashboard-dir (ServeDir): same, all 200, process ALIVE.\nAlso probed CORS Origin, OPTIONS preflight, Range, missing asset, path traversal — all handled, no crash, in debug AND release.\nCode analysis: serve_embedded is panic-safe (header() stores error, body().unwrap_or_else catches it; mime_guess yields valid ASCII). No panic=abort in any profile, no process::exit/abort, no unsafe, no panic hook in the request path. Under panic=unwind a per-connection handler panic returns 500 and cannot kill the process. The only process-killers (stack overflow / abort) have no path here for a static GET.\nConclusion: not a reproducible code defect in the static-serving path on current code. Likely environment-specific (their Linux build/runtime) or browser-triggered WS/PTY, or a stale binary. Need the reporter's RUST_BACKTRACE output + exit signal (dmesg for SIGSEGV/OOM) to localize.","created_at":"2026-06-22T19:00:04.227631730Z","kind":"observation"}}
